      "html": "<section class=\"g2-figure\" data-scene=\"dl-safe-pipeline\"><span class=\"g2-kicker\">QUESTION 05 · VISUAL LESSON</span><div class=\"g2-canvas\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 410\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"dl-redesign-5-title dl-redesign-5-desc\"><title id=\"dl-redesign-5-title\">dl redesign 5</title><desc id=\"dl-redesign-5-desc\">Topic-specific visual explanation of dl redesign 5</desc><defs><linearGradient id=\"dl-redesign-5-wash\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop stop-color=\"#F5FCFE\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#FFF9F2\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"998\" height=\"408\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"url(#dl-redesign-5-wash)\" stroke=\"#D6E7E9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"419\" y=\"70\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"850\" fill=\"#168E83\" text-anchor=\"middle\">TRAIN-FOLD PIPELINE</text><path d=\"M80 282H753\" stroke=\"#168E83\" stroke-width=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M95 301H739\" stroke=\"#86D0C0\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"142\" cy=\"194\" r=\"55\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#168E83\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><text x=\"142\" y=\"207\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#168E83\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"142\" y=\"113\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"750\" fill=\"#26495C\" text-anchor=\"middle\">IMPUTE</text><circle cx=\"313\" cy=\"194\" r=\"55\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#168E83\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><text x=\"313\" y=\"207\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#168E83\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"313\" y=\"113\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"750\" fill=\"#26495C\" text-anchor=\"middle\">SCALE</text><circle cx=\"484\" cy=\"194\" r=\"55\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#168E83\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><text x=\"484\" y=\"207\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#168E83\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"484\" y=\"113\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"750\" fill=\"#26495C\" text-anchor=\"middle\">SELECT</text><circle cx=\"655\" cy=\"194\" r=\"55\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#518FB8\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><text x=\"655\" y=\"207\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#518FB8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><text x=\"655\" y=\"113\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"750\" fill=\"#26495C\" text-anchor=\"middle\">MODEL</text><path d=\"M79 100Q30 194 79 334\" stroke=\"#86D0C0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"9 11\"/><path d=\"M760 99Q801 215 760 333\" stroke=\"#86D0C0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"9 11\"/><path d=\"M398 312v-19a19 19 0 0 1 38 0v19\" stroke=\"#168E83\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"383\" y=\"311\" width=\"68\" height=\"55\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#168E83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"417\" cy=\"331\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#168E83\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M417 336v11\" stroke=\"#168E83\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"885\" cy=\"221\" r=\"59\" fill=\"#EAF7FB\" stroke=\"#518FB8\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"885\" y=\"215\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"850\" fill=\"#518FB8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">VALID</text><path d=\"M867 247l10 11l20 -24\" stroke=\"#518FB8\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M754 230L822 230\" stroke=\"#518FB8\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M810.2382283781404 235.53721304585798L822 230L810.2382283781404 224.46278695414202\" stroke=\"#518FB8\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></div><section class=\"g2-code\" aria-label=\"Runnable scikit-learn Pipeline example\"><div class=\"g2-code-label\">PYTHON · LEAKAGE-SAFE CROSS-VALIDATION</div><pre><code>from sklearn.datasets import make_classification\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\nfrom sklearn.impute import SimpleImputer\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom sklearn.feature_selection import SelectKBest, f_classif\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import cross_val_score\n\nX, y = make_classification(\n    n_samples=160, n_features=8, random_state=4\n)\npipe = Pipeline([\n    (\"impute\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\")),\n    (\"scale\", StandardScaler()),\n    (\"select\", SelectKBest(score_func=f_classif, k=5)),\n    (\"model\", LogisticRegression(max_iter=1000))\n])\nscores = cross_val_score(pipe, X, y, cv=5)\nprint(round(scores.mean(), 3))</code></pre><p>Each cross-validation run refits the imputer, scaler, selector, and classifier on its training fold.</p></section></section>"
    },
